sume is not any part of the Universe - so a legacy focused on removing Abyssal corruption would work. And finally i think a legacy decidated to summoning Supernal beings could fit nicely... Might even allow one member to summon being from multiple paths.<br /> <br /> I'm not sure how deep one would need to be into Pantheism to join one of these legacies, but there could be a mystery cult/nameless order which collectively represents the core philosophy, and a number of legacies acting independently pursuing their own service to the Universe.</div> </div> </div> </div>I like all of that. I could see them using Life as their main Arcanum","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-11T15:27:45-08:00","id":1496859,"title":"","content":"I should say, i am a Pantheist. I may or may not include a Spinozan mage in my next chronicle.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27248-orathaic","name":"orathaic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27248_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1032"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-11T15:29:25-08:00","id":1496860,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>orathaic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1496846-pantheistic-legacy?p=1496859#post1496859\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I should say, i am a Pantheist. I may or may not include a Spinozan mage in my next chronicle.</div> </div> </div> </div>I just learned about it today,would you mind answering some more questions?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-11T16:10:22-08:00","id":1496865,"title":"","content":"Magic knows itself through Prime, which focuses on truth and revelation. Emotions beget ideas, ideas seek propagation, their propagation makes them more real, more present in our lives. Unless you know the secrets of Spirit, these principles that create reality Ex Nihilo (since high Ranking spirits can just make new things pop into existence) remain obscured.<br /> <br /> The God Machine is tremendously vast, knows the natural order, edits its own backdoors into it, creates systems harnessing it and hides from the world, then perhaps it holds the answers. <br /> <br /> Focus on studying the Machine, if you start comprehending its plans on a holistic level, then you will understand how it all fits together. With sufficient knowledge of both it and the Shadow, then a model for fundamentally creating or altering major aspects of reality may be designed, the pinnacle of the Ars Nova.<br /> <br /> I would probably make their approach heavily inspired by <a href=\"http://whitewolf.fandom.com/wiki/Tychoidian_Cosmology\" target=\"_blank\">Tychoidian Cosmology</a> as a way to see Pantheism under a technognostic lens.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2648"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-11T23:28:07-08:00","id":1496897,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nicolas Milioni</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1496846-pantheistic-legacy?p=1496860#post1496860\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I just learned about it today,would you mind answering some more questions?</div> </div> </div> </div>If you like, not sure if you want to PM or post in the thread but happy to chat about it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27248-orathaic","name":"orathaic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27248_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1032"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-12T07:06:28-08:00","id":1496909,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>orathaic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1496846-pantheistic-legacy?p=1496897#post1496897\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> If you like, not sure if you want to PM or post in the thread but happy to chat about it.</div> </div> </div> </div>Say,is Is it right that some Pantheists believe the Universe is sentient,others that it is not?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4621,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","user":"Nicolas Milioni","date":". 11-12-2022, 11:51 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-12T15:21:18-08:00","id":1496940,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nicolas Milioni</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1496846-pantheistic-legacy?p=1496909#post1496909\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Say,is Is it right that some Pantheists believe the Universe is sentient,others that it is not?</div> </div> </div> </div>Possibly, i can't say i talk to many other Pantheists, it is not an organised religion. But from my perspective, parts of the Universe are clearly sentient (us) but we don't know how to ascribed human-like qualities (like sentience) to the whole.<br /> <br /> I think religions tend to personify/antromorphize their deities. And thus praying to them to ask for favour makes sense (if telepathy works); but Spinoza (having been raised in Judaism) would have flipped the script on that one - saying something along the lines of, 'God has given you the faculties to answer your own prayers. Instead of sitting and hoping for the Universe to hand you what you need, you should study the Universe, understand how it works, and manipulate things to create the things you needs' (very much compatible with Science as it happens, which could be considered the study of God from a Spinozan perspective).<br /> <br /> My own understanding of nature includes bees/ants, and how their hive minds work (collective intelligence out of individual (near) automata) so it is possible that the Universe has a sentience of sorts, within our understanding of how things actually work. But that doesn't mean it is on a scale of human understanding (maybe each galaxy is an individual, and billions of years pass between meaningful interactions...)<br /> <br /> (Edit: i hope i am doing Spinozan's philosophy a fair explaination, i came up with it first and was then utterly disgusted to find out that he had stolen my ideas and then had the audacity to travelled back in time 400 years before i was born just to claim the credit <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> - so i may be mixing my own beliefs up with Spinozan's at times)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":27248,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27248-orathaic","user":"orathaic","date":". 01-25-2023, 07:41 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27248-orathaic","name":"orathaic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27248_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1032"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-12T15:54:05-08:00","id":1496946,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>orathaic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1496846-pantheistic-legacy?p=1496940#post1496940\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Possibly, i can't say i talk to many other Pa